{"ID":"20230925154307-lr3ncu8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154307-lr3ncu8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154307-lr3ncu8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154311-jfiosvv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154311-n9mghkk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154318-1d41qj2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【桔梗汤】（桔梗甘草汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154318"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154311-jfiosvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154311-jfiosvv","updated":"20230925154311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桔梗汤，又名桔梗甘草汤：桔梗一两，生甘草二两；"}]},{"ID":"20230925154311-hgk6sa4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154311-hgk6sa4","updated":"20230925154311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右二味，以水三升，煮取一升，去滓，温分再服。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154317-lzzi95n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154317-lzzi95n"}},{"ID":"20230925154311-gcqzpo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154311-gcqzpo1","updated":"20230925154311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【15.3】隔间停留瘀血，若吐血色黑者，桔梗汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154318-1d41qj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154318-1d41qj2"}},{"ID":"20230925154311-vlzfze0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154311-vlzfze0","updated":"20230925154311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药方结构：桔梗把身体的脓挤出来，然后生甘草进行消炎；这样子慢慢吃下去，吐得脓会越来越少，是这样一个缓缓有效的方剂；桔梗汤更倾向于作用上焦；"}]},{"ID":"20230925154311-n9mghkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154311-n9mghkk","updated":"20230925154311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可治肺痈和少阴病喉咙痛；少阴病喉咙痛和别的喉咙痛有什么不一样？少阴病是因为少阴经的能量支援人体扁桃腺的存在，一旦少阴经有邪气，能量上不来，扁桃腺就开始萎缩坏死，得不到生命能变成一坨死肉，因为是死肉，所以消炎也没用，所以治这类喉咙痛每天要喝桔梗汤，把不好的组织慢慢推出来这样医；"}]}]}